---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Transparency">
  <div class="bg-gray-50 py-16">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A2B4C] mb-8">Transparent Administration</h1>
      
      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-12 text-lg">
        In compliance with the transparency obligations provided for by the Third Sector Code (D.Lgs. 117/2017) 
        and Law 124/2017, the Pax et Sapientia Foundation publishes in this section documents relating to its management and the public contributions received.
      </p>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6">
        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-100 shadow-sm flex items-center justify-between">
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-[#1A2B4C]">Annual Financial Statements</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Annual accounting document approved by the Board of Directors.</p>
          </div>
          <span class="text-sm text-gray-400 font-mono italic">Awaiting publication</span>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-100 shadow-sm flex items-center justify-between">
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-[#1A2B4C]">Public Contributions (L. 124/2017)</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Annual report of economic benefits received from the Public Administration.</p>
          </div>
          <span class="text-sm text-gray-400 font-mono italic">Awaiting publication</span>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-100 shadow-sm flex items-center justify-between">
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-[#1A2B4C]">Social Balance Sheet</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Mandatory for entities with revenues exceeding 1 million euros.</p>
          </div>
          <span class="text-sm text-gray-400 font-mono italic">Not mandatory for the current year</span>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-100 shadow-sm flex items-center justify-between">
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-[#1A2B4C]">Emoluments and Compensation</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Publication of compensation to administration and control bodies.</p>
          </div>
          <span class="text-sm text-gray-400 font-mono italic">Not due (gratuitous positions)</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
